    },
    "render_sketch": {
      "summary": "The plan picture of an outdoor project's sketch.yml (`oymap render-sketch`): land, water, roads, districts, plots, points, areas, drawn from what can be read (also a sketch that still has issues). As PNG bytes in the answer.",
